{"lang":"es","dir":"ltr","title":"Napa Valley Nails Salon | Manicura, pedicura y acrílicas en Napa, CA","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Ir al contenido</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NV</span><span>Napa Valley Nails Salon</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">Nosotros</a><a href=\"#services\">Servicios</a><a href=\"#faq\">Preguntas</a><a href=\"#gallery\">Fotos</a><a href=\"#reviews\">Reseñas</a><a href=\"#visit\">Horario y ubicación</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"Idioma\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\" selected>Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\">Llamar</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/salon-interior.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Salón de uñas · Trancas St, Napa</p>\n    <h1>Napa Valley Nails Salon</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Manicura, pedicura, gel, dip y acrílicas en Trancas Street, con un equipo amable en el que nuestras clientas confían desde hace años.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · 69 reseñas en Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Llama para reservar</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%2C%20706%20Trancas%20St%2C%20Ste%20A%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Cómo llegar</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4.8★ de 69 reseñas</a></li><li>Se atiende sin cita</li><li>Manicura y pedicura</li><li>Gel, dip y acrílicas</li><li>Nail art</li><li>Aceptamos tarjetas de crédito</li><li>Estacionamiento privado</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">El salón</p><h2>Limpio, amable y relajante.</h2><p>Napa Valley Nails Salon es un salón de uñas de servicio completo en 706 Trancas Street en Napa. Hacemos manicura, pedicura, gel, polvo dip, acrílicas, extensiones y nail art para mujeres y hombres.</p><p>Nuestro salón es limpio e higiénico, con una enorme variedad de colores, y nuestras clientas regresan por pedicuras relajantes, masajes de pies y acrílicas delgadas de aspecto natural. Nuestro equipo incluye a Ann, Lee, Joe, Kenny, Kevin y Kim.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>69 reseñas</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Nextdoor</b><span>Favorito del vecindario</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>6 días</b><span>Abierto de lun a sáb</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/red-manicure.jpg\" alt=\"Manicura roja recién hecha\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Menú</p><h2>Servicios</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Manicura</h3></div><p>Manicura clásica, y también manicura para hombre.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Pedicura</h3></div><p>Pedicuras relajantes y masajes de pies. También pedicura para hombre.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Manicura y pedicura</h3></div><p>Las dos juntas en una sola visita.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Uñas de gel</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Uñas de polvo dip</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Uñas acrílicas</h3></div><p>Acrílicas delgadas y de aspecto natural que, según los vecinos, duran de 3 a 4 semanas sin levantarse.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Extensiones de gel y extensiones de uñas</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Nail art</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Esmalte de uñas</h3></div><p>Una enorme variedad de colores para elegir.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">10</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Depilación con cera</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">11</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Cuidado de la piel</h3></div></article></div><p class=\"note\">No publicamos precios en línea. Llama al (707) 252-4551 para conocer los precios actuales.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Bueno saber</p><h2>Bueno saber</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Se atiende sin cita</b><span>Si quieres una técnica en particular, conviene llamar antes</span></li><li><b>Aceptamos tarjetas de crédito</b></li><li><b>Estacionamiento privado</b></li><li><b>Estacionamiento para bicicletas</b></li><li><b>Baños para todos los géneros</b></li><li><b>Servicios para hombres</b><span>Manicura y pedicura para hombre</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>Trabajos recientes</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/gel-colors.jpg\" alt=\"Manicura de gel multicolor\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/red-nail-art.jpg\" alt=\"Diseño de uñas rojo\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/silver-glitter.jpg\" alt=\"Uñas con brillo plateado\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-red.jpg\" alt=\"Manicura roja clásica\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lace-nails.jpg\" alt=\"Uñas largas blancas\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lilac-gel.jpg\" alt=\"Uñas de gel lila\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/natural-nude.jpg\" alt=\"Manicura nude natural\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lavender-nails.jpg\" alt=\"Manicura lavanda\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reconocimiento</p><h2>Favorito del vecindario</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“NAPA Valley Nails is a Neighborhood Favorite in 1 neighborhood. It also won in 2020, 2022 and 2023.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Nextdoor Fave Awards</b> · Nextdoor Neighborhood Favorite · <a href=\"https://nextdoor.com/pages/napa-valley-nails-napa-ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 69 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Google →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Love 💕 this nail salon. The team does a great job (just what I ask for) and are welcoming and can almost always fit me in at the last minute. Thank you Ann for years of service and friendship.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“The nail salon employees here are very nice, and take good care of your nails. They give great massages and are hygienic.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My wife and I both got a nice relaxing pedicure on vacation! I mean, when she uses that buffer kind of roughly, I&#39;m crawling up the back of the chair... But my feet feel so nice now! The foot massage was wonderful. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Lee did an exceptional service, my feet are so clean, relaxed and painted! I’m so excited they look great! I’m falling asleep being so comfortable and relaxed I couldn’t help it!! I’m coming back for more !!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/napa/napa-valley-nails-salon-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“They did a wonderful job, charge very reasonably, and do a great acrylics.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Ann did my pedicure and my manicure! Not only did she do such a stunning job, she was so sweet and kind. I really enjoyed our time together and our little chats :) she’s an absolute doll and truly made my nail appointment an experience. Please please please go here and ask for her if she’s in! Calling ahead is a good idea to make sure she can take you. Thank you, Ann!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have finally made Napa Valley Nails my place !! My experience has always been pleasurable. Anna is so sweet and does an amazing and detailed job.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2019</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I just went to this shop yesterday and will definitely be coming back! This place is so clean and carries a huge variety of colors to choose from. My nail tech Anna did an amazing job. She was very kind and pleasant to me. I absolutely love it here and will come back very soon.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2019</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Necesito cita?</summary><p>Se atiende sin cita, y casi siempre te podemos atender de último momento. Si quieres una técnica en particular, llama antes al (707) 252-4551.</p></details><details><summary>¿Qué servicios ofrecen?</summary><p>Manicura, pedicura, uñas de gel, polvo dip, acrílicas, extensiones de gel y normales, nail art y esmalte, además de manicura y pedicura para hombre. La depilación con cera y el cuidado de la piel también están en nuestra lista.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuál es su horario?</summary><p>Abrimos de lunes a viernes de 9:30 AM a 6:30 PM y el sábado de 9:30 AM a 6 PM. Cerramos el domingo.</p></details><details><summary>¿Dónde están ubicados?</summary><p>Estamos en 706 Trancas St, Suite A, Napa, CA 94558, con estacionamiento privado.</p></details><details><summary>¿Aceptan tarjetas de crédito?</summary><p>Sí, aceptamos tarjetas de crédito.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuánto cuestan los servicios?</summary><p>No publicamos precios en línea, pero los mantenemos muy razonables. Llámanos al (707) 252-4551 para conocer los precios actual